<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Say</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>say &lt;words to speak&gt;
' &lt;words to speak&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>say Hello, can anyone help me?
' Hello!
</pre>
<p>Eventually while playing the game you will need to communicate with others. One 
way is say: everyone in the room with you hears what you say. It is by no means 
a private way to speak to someone: as in real life, anyone in the room hears it. 
End with&#160;? and you ask, end with&#160;! and you exclaim.
</p><p>Say can be abbreviated to a single '. Be warned: if you forget the ', the first 
word is read as a command, and that may do something you didn't intend.
</p><p>Two more such shortcuts: a , at the start is an emote (see <a cmd='#'>Help Emotes</a>), and&#160;! 
alone repeats your last command.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
